      "question": "What event or condition triggers the scheduling of a vendor meeting — is it a recurring calendar interval, a specific equipment performance issue, or a request from either the internal team or the vendor?",
      "answer": "The meeting is triggered by an improvement request or an equipment issue summary. These inputs prompt the equipment engineer to prepare an agenda, which then initiates scheduling. Whether this follows a recurring interval or is purely event-driven is not specified."
    },
